Item #: SCP-5156
&lt;p&gt;Object Class: Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Special Containment procedures: SCP-5156 need to be contained in a locked room dimensions of 10 and 9 feet except for testing procedures. Clearance of level 4 personnel may enter it&#039;s containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Description: SCP-5156 is a humanoid scp which has power of getting ignored especially for scp&#039;s. This effect doesn&#039;t seem to work on humans. The SCP foundation get to know it&#039;s power on a cleaning session of SCP-173&#039;s containment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Origin: On a cleaning session of SCP-173&#039;s Containment SCP-5156 entered along with another two D-Class personnel. Unfortunately the power went out the researchers heard two crunching of necks.&lt;br /&gt;
The personnel managed to get power back on they see SCP-5156 crouching in fear as SCP-173 starred at it. The researchers were shocked to see this as SCP-5156 was asked to come out&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum: As the incident has shocked the researchers but also it made them curious to see what happens if they tested it with other scp&#039;s. This SCP handled by Dr.Rivian he is an unstoppable researchers if he started nothing can stop him.&lt;br /&gt;
This not only it&#039;s power it&#039;s true power revealed at SCP-173&#039;s Containment breach. Dr.Martha a female researcher who worked near SCP-173&#039;s Containment.&lt;br /&gt;
That day the gates of SCP-173&#039;s chamber opened SCP-173 moves towards the Dr but suddenly SCP-5156 appeared and attacked SCP-173 by grabbing it&#039;s throat and throwing it down&lt;/p&gt;
