- Oscar Wilde&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #9cd3e9ff; padding: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px; text-align: center; width: 700px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Whatever you&#039;re thinking this means, it means that.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
- Harry Blank&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #9cd3e9ff; padding: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
