&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px; text-align: center; width: 700px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Site-43&#039;s History is Fuckin&#039; Esoteric Trilogy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #D8ECF4; padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 12px; padding-top: 6px; padding-bottom: 6px&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;The Cure, and What Ails You&amp;quot;&lt;/th&gt;
