						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div class="meta-title"> <p>AnAstAsis hub</p> </div> <div style="float: right"></div> <br /> <br /> <div class="blockquote" style="border-style: solid;"> <p>I never thought I'd see that beast again.</p> <p>Defeating it had been my purpose, my goal, and yet here it was years later, resurrected and stronger than ever. And with it came other monsters, crawling from the depths of the earth to join its queen. With my task force's resources spread thin, I almost lost hope.</p> <p>But the Foundation had something up its sleeve. It always does.</p> <p>We were going to finish our decades-long war once and for all.</p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="font-size:75%;"><em>-Testimony from Perseus Rosales, Captain of Mobile Task Force Eta-5 (&quot;Jäeger Bombers&quot;)</em></span></p> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Rebuild.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="grant-request-for-mechacrocosquid"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box one"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/grant-request-for-mechacrocosquid">GRANT REQUEST FOR THE CYBERNETIC MODIFICATION OF THE CORPSE OF THE CROCOTEUTHIS GIGANTIS</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/grant-request-for-mechacrocosquid">Prometheus Labs</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>Ain't done with this yet.</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Rise.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="5391"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box two"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5391">SCP-5391</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5391">Anastasis</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>This is now a war on all fronts.</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Awaken.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="awakening"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box three"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/awakening">Awakening</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/awakening">The Deep Sea</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>This was the start of a war— No, the awakening of a new world.</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Feed.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="queen-of-the-monsters"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box four"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/queen-of-the-monsters">Queen of the Monsters</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/queen-of-the-monsters">The Open Ocean</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>It's been a while since we last saw you, hasn't it?</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Raise.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="critter-profile-cappi"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box six"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/critter-profile-cappi">Critter Profile: Cappi!</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/critter-profile-cappi">An Intermission</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>&quot;Mr. Wilson, I think we befriended a giant monster.&quot;</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Learn.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="5437"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box five"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5437">SCP-5437</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5437">A Beast Cast from Heaven</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>A god spends millennia dreaming and dying in its own temple.</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Return.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="reviviscence"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box seven"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviviscence">Reviviscence</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviviscence">Wanderer's Library</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>Many secrets are kept in the depths of the Library.</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Kill.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="scp-5514"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box eight"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5514">SCP-5514</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5514">The Dragonslayer</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>The war on all fronts comes to an end.</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>After.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="when-its-all-over"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box nine"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/when-its-all-over">When It's All Over</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/when-its-all-over">Epilogue</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>Is it really the end?</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/anastasis-hub/P4.png" alt="P4.png" class="image" /> <p><span style="font-size:60%;"><strong>The Serpent by A Talented Person!!! (this will be replaced later)</strong></span></p> </div> <p></p> <div class="licensebox"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> reviv.jpg<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> benuski<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/benuski/3502143020/">Flickr</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> grant.jpg<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> _Alicja_<br /> <strong>License:</strong> Public Domain<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://pixabay.com/photos/crocodile-gad-animal-skin-2559534/">Pixabay (from 2017, so still compliant)</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> awakening.jpg<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Raymond Shobe<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/43521640@N00/37699410561">Flickr</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> queen.jpg<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> seabamirum<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/59323989@N00/4533288746">Flickr</a></p> </blockquote> <p>over2.jpg cropped from <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/when-its-all-over">When Its All Over</a>'s image</p> <p>All other images are from the articles linked.</p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3656445&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608992529" alt="Ellie3" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3656445)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" >Ellie3</a></span></p> 
