&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warning:&lt;/strong&gt; My activity on the site varies, and I may be AWOL for extended periods. Feel free to yell at me because of this.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General Info:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
I have eaten a cubic foot of chicken parmesan in under 10 minutes. My Dad is the ultimate being. I have the same birthday as my two best friends. I have a weird fixation on pineapple. Popeye is the strongest anime character of all time. I am fated to die in an IHOP. I listen to a lot of classic rock and hair metal, I can recommend songs if you want. I love you. If you start talking to me about D&amp;amp;D, buckle in because we&#039;ll be here a while. I own a Muppet version of myself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a rule of thumb, expect whatever I make to be weird. Sometimes for comedic effect, sometimes to scare, it&#039;ll always be bizarre if it&#039;s coming from me. My articles are rarely all-the-way serious, but aside from the occasional grim piece expect at least one joke per article. I like to think I&#039;m good at interesting monster design, but I still haven&#039;t really written many creature features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am open to collabs, as they are fun, and it is cool to see other people&#039;s takes on your ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need me, leave a pm on wikidot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you dislike any of my works, let me know why, so I can make them un-suck. I love getting feedback, and I read all comments in the discussions of my articles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things Written (Oldest To Newest):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3386&quot;&gt;SCP-3386&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
It&#039;s about owls. Co-authored with &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608992529&quot; alt=&quot;Zyn&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn&quot;  &gt;Zyn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3446&quot;&gt;SCP-3446&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Magic rubber pants that take you to the mud world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3646&quot;&gt;SCP-3646&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Mosquitoes suck. Even when they&#039;re dead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3516&quot;&gt;SCP-3516&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Magic Bicycle Of Pain. One of my funnier articles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3836&quot;&gt;SCP-3836&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
GOTTA GO FAST. My personal favorite, where I show my skill at crafting quirky characters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/rainy-monday|&quot;&gt;Rainy Monday&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
My first ever tale, written about everybody&#039;s favorite Garfield skip. &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/oogas-house/garf.jpeg&quot;&gt;Bonus art!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3586&quot;&gt;SCP-3586&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
A dumb idea that &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608992529&quot; alt=&quot;not_a_seagull&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull&quot;  &gt;not_a_seagull&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;(fittingly) and me came up with once. Was fun to write.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4116&quot;&gt;SCP-4116&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Based off of real nightmares I had as a kid. I hope to expand upon it in the future, as it is another one of my favorites. &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/oogas-house/kingus.jpg&quot;&gt;Also here&#039;s some art.&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/oogas-house/4116.jpg&quot;&gt;And some more, by the illustrious SunnyClockwork!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3596&quot;&gt;SCP-3596&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Power, Rangers, baby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/dk-class-donkey-kong-scenario&quot;&gt;DK-Class Donkey Kong Scenario&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
You know when you have an idea, a &lt;em&gt;really bad&lt;/em&gt; one, and no matter what you can&#039;t get it out of your mind until you do something with it? Yeah.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/renaissance-of-fear&quot;&gt;Renassance Of Fear&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
More Kingus, and my first full tale on the site. Hopefully, the first in a series of more to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5266&quot;&gt;SCP-5266&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
My weirdest article, and that&#039;s sayin something. Be prepared for action sequences set to Village People songs.&lt;/p&gt;
