					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <br /> <span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>Warning:</strong> My activity on the site varies, and I may be AWOL for extended periods. Feel free to yell at me because of this.</span> <p><strong>General Info:</strong><br /> I have eaten a cubic foot of chicken parmesan in under 10 minutes. My Dad is the ultimate being. I have the same birthday as my two best friends. I have a weird fixation on pineapple. Popeye is the strongest anime character of all time. I am fated to die in an IHOP. I listen to a lot of classic rock and hair metal, I can recommend songs if you want. I love you. If you start talking to me about D&amp;D, buckle in because we'll be here a while. I own a Muppet version of myself.</p> <p>As a rule of thumb, expect whatever I make to be weird. Sometimes for comedic effect, sometimes to scare, it'll always be bizarre if it's coming from me. My articles are rarely all-the-way serious, but aside from the occasional grim piece expect at least one joke per article. I like to think I'm good at interesting monster design, but I still haven't really written many creature features.</p> <p>I am open to collabs, as they are fun, and it is cool to see other people's takes on your ideas.</p> <p>If you need me, leave a pm on wikidot.</p> <p>If you dislike any of my works, let me know why, so I can make them un-suck. I love getting feedback, and I read all comments in the discussions of my articles.</p> <p><strong>Things Written (Oldest To Newest):</strong></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3386">SCP-3386</a><br /> It's about owls. Co-authored with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608992529" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span>.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3446">SCP-3446</a><br /> Magic rubber pants that take you to the mud world.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3646">SCP-3646</a><br /> Mosquitoes suck. Even when they're dead.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3516">SCP-3516</a><br /> Magic Bicycle Of Pain. One of my funnier articles.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3836">SCP-3836</a><br /> GOTTA GO FAST. My personal favorite, where I show my skill at crafting quirky characters.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/rainy-monday|">Rainy Monday</a><br /> My first ever tale, written about everybody's favorite Garfield skip. <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/oogas-house/garf.jpeg">Bonus art!</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3586">SCP-3586</a><br /> A dumb idea that <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608992529" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span>(fittingly) and me came up with once. Was fun to write.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4116">SCP-4116</a><br /> Based off of real nightmares I had as a kid. I hope to expand upon it in the future, as it is another one of my favorites. <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/oogas-house/kingus.jpg">Also here's some art.</a> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/oogas-house/4116.jpg">And some more, by the illustrious SunnyClockwork!</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3596">SCP-3596</a><br /> Power, Rangers, baby.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dk-class-donkey-kong-scenario">DK-Class Donkey Kong Scenario</a><br /> You know when you have an idea, a <em>really bad</em> one, and no matter what you can't get it out of your mind until you do something with it? Yeah.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/renaissance-of-fear">Renassance Of Fear</a><br /> More Kingus, and my first full tale on the site. Hopefully, the first in a series of more to come.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5266">SCP-5266</a><br /> My weirdest article, and that's sayin something. Be prepared for action sequences set to Village People songs.</p> <p><strong>The Sandbox Of Way Too Many Ideas:</strong><br /> <a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/iamtheooga">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/iamtheooga</a></p> <p><strong>Other Stuff I like:</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Cool&nbsp;Dudes&nbsp;And&nbsp;Dudettes</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608992529" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span> [<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/floppyphoenix">Author's Page</a>]<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608992529" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span> [<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/not-a-seagull">Author's Page</a>]<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><